    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index leapt 2,553 points higher week-on-week to 15,841, now more than 9,000 points above the year-ago level. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate climbed by $2.10/t to $21.20/t, while there was a $9,350/day rise in the Pacific round-voyage rate to $76,350/day.",
